# 统一行尾策略：仓库内一律 LF（与 .editorconfig end_of_line = lf 一致）
# Windows 工作区检出时由 git 转换为 CRLF（依赖个人 core.autocrlf=true）
# 提交时统一归一化为 LF，消除 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告混乱

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本必须保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
